flowchart TD
    A[controller throws / validation fails] --> B[errorMiddleware]
    B --> C{error type}
    C -->|Mongoose ValidationError| D[400 field messages]
    C -->|CastError| E[400 malformed id]
    C -->|JsonWebToken / expired| F[401]
    C -->|express-validator| G[400 array of field errors]
    C -->|generic| H[500 message]
    D & E & F & G & H --> I[response: json message]
    I --> J[client axios interceptor]
    J --> K[ui slice toast / inline form error]
